{"id":"wb-7-43","name":"古魏城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"古魏城遗址","text":"古魏城遗址，位于山西省运城市芮城县城关镇北2.5公里，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n此地为西周初年分封的姬姓伯国，筑城于此，至汉末废弃。\n1996年1月12日，公布为山西省文物保护单位，编号3-19。2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位，是一座古遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E9%AD%8F%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92838061,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92838061","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c4725dd1e262836993e2a6a7.jpg","title":"20260504_Site_of_Ancient_Wei_City_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260504_Site_of_Ancient_Wei_City_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/20260504_Site_of_Ancient_Wei_City_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​山西芮城 古魏城遗址","width":320,"height":213}}